ok - host: a decision close accepted away whose turn starts attended still reaches main unchanged
ok - host: an attended close whose task turns main-only before its turn still reaches main unchanged
ok - host: a primary with no verified dialog mirror keeps every attended close on main, and its away posture still runs
ok - host: each wake carries the captain's dialog since the last wake, without operational input
ok - host: the dialog mirror, its feed, and the wake file are owner-only
